on if you can manage PHP without a GUI interface. For Trello and Word: is t=
here anyone who doesn=E2=80=99t know how to use these?</p>
<p>The person is also using terms like =E2=80=9Cexpert=E2=80=9D and =E2=80=
=9Cproficient=E2=80=9D. This is a double-edged sword, as it implies that th=
e person is not an expert in other languages. Also, talking with recruiters=
, the self-evaluation of people means little: several technical recruiters =
mentioned that people who rated themselves as an expert in a specific langu=
age would often get rejected based on not having enough depth, after being =
grilled in the depths of that language.</p>
<p><strong>As a rule of thumb, avoid listing your expertise level</strong>.=
 Instead, list only languages that you feel proficient with, and list your =
strongest languages and technologies first.</p>
