work experience.  The first entry, spanning from 2018 to the present, lists=
 her role as 'Head of Engineering' at TwoDrive in Berlin, Germany, with bul=
let points describing her accomplishments, including team growth from one t=
o eight engineers, MVP development and subsequent releases, development env=
ironment setup with CI/CD and testing practices, and the establishment of a=
 loosely-coupled, event-driven architecture using AWS, Kubernetes, Kafka, a=
nd Java services.  The second entry, from 2016 to 2018, shows her previous =
position as 'Senior Engineer' at OneDrive in Amsterdam, Netherlands.  The e=
ntire resume uses a clean, structured layout with clear section headings an=
d bullet points to present her qualifications effectively." loading=3D"lazy=
