<p><strong>Resume 2=E2=80=94staying on the manager track:</strong></p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display: flex; justify-content: center=
;"><img alt=3D"Image represents a tech resume for Ashley Sliden (my_email@e=
